00:18:39,000 --> 00:18:41,639
<i>Ini tak mungkin!</i>

289
00:18:41,640 --> 00:18:43,159
<i>Ini cuma pubertas.</i>

290
00:18:43,160 --> 00:18:46,334
<i>Itu cuma laba-laba normal
dan aku anak normal!</i>

291
