MILES MENCARI JAWABAN...

294
00:18:54,680 --> 00:18:57,217
<i>Aku harus memberi tahu seseorang.</i>

295
00:18:59,300 --> 00:19:00,217
AYAH

296
00:19:20,280 --> 00:19:23,818
Baiklah, kau gila, Miles.
Kau gila.

297
