305
00:20:20,640 --> 00:20:21,839
<i>Kau sepertiku.</i>

306
00:20:21,840 --> 00:20:23,639
<i>Miles. Awas.</i>

307
00:20:23,640 --> 00:20:26,735
<i>Aku tak ingin jadi pahlawan. /
